      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Every scene has a link: Share… → Copy link.\n\n• Your own scenes: kurviq.com/roadmap; shared ones: kurviq.com/s/…/roadmap\n• Anyone with the link: everyone can view it, no sign-in\n• Copy presentation link opens it presenting\n• Make a copy puts any shared scene into your own scenes",
