      "text": "Every frame is a slide. Open Slides (top left):\n\n• Present fullscreen, with laser pointer and \na presenter view with notes and timer\n• Template: header, footer and logo on all \nslides\n• Sort: drag slides around, duplicate, delete\n• PDF of the whole deck",
      "fontSize": 34,
