      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Every frame is a slide. Open Slides (top left):\n\n• Present fullscreen, with laser pointer and a presenter view with notes and timer\n• Template: header, footer and logo on all slides\n• Sort: drag slides around, duplicate, delete\n• PDF of the whole deck",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
